Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "SH0!1,5|30;!1+40!1+Q1!2'^;0!1,@|510;!2'^;0!1,@|32;!3,^:13!3,^:14!1,O1!3+22!1'6!1,;#1!3'^91!1'6#15!1,;#2!1'67!1'6#2!1+22!1'6#3!3,^:13!3,^:14;!3,^:14<!3'^91;5!3,^:14>%l;R22!1+21!4'^?22::!1,^:1%~R1@!4'^?1@AB!4'^@DE!3'^ADE!4'^B1@B!4'^B22:!1'^C2C!3'^91<5$j;R+0!4'1$j;R+06!2,82!3'^91!1'6,95$j;R+0$IH;R6vd!2$lemma;R!3+228!3'^9195!9'^<2:!1'^=2!3,^:13=!3,^:13?!;'^>1@ABCF3!2'^D13=?!;'^>1@ABCF4!2'^D14<>#1GG!2'^D2G#1!2,82!3'^91!3,^:13!3,^:1495!3+22!1'6!1,;7!3'^9185#1").
